title: '`pallet-broker`: clean up, document, and test `swap_leases`'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Removes the dead `id_leases_count`/`other_leases_count` counters in `do_swap_leases`
      (unused since #3714), documents the previously undocumented `swap_leases` call, and adds
      its first unit test (swap both directions, self-swap no-op, unknown tasks).
      No behavior change; the existing weight remains conservative.

crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: none
